The MIT licence covers this source code only.

It does NOT cover the legislation this project indexes. The corpus consists of
official publications of UAE federal and Dubai government bodies, and their
copyright and terms of use belong to those publishers. This repository does not
redistribute them: only their URLs and SHA-256 digests are committed, and
`corpus/download.py` fetches them at build time. See corpus/README.md.

